// environment or -Darg_weaponry.dev_weapons=true.
//
// It deliberately reuses the real default pack's display, model and texture resources, so holding
// this item exercises exactly the same load, cache, anchor and draw path as a production weapon.
// The original dmr_ammo.json is untouched.
